    "updated_at": "2015-09-11T16:21:03Z",
    "body": "@rniwa I generally agree with you. Maybe it would be best to let the shadow DOM spec maintain the list of disallowed elements for now, and when there is general agreement we can add it back in to HTML? (Probably at the same time much of the rest of the spec gets incorporated into DOM and HTML.)\n",
