    "updated_at": "2015-09-17T18:30:42Z",
    "body": "OK. @hayatoito, can you take the action item to:\n1. Update the shadow DOM spec to not reference the \"binding\" property in its non-normative note, and possibly update the non-normative note to say \"we plan to move this to HTML, but development is taking place here for now.\"\n2. Open a tracking issue on the shadow DOM spec for moving the list to HTML?\n\nOnce those tasks are completed we can close this PR, and resurrect it later once shadow DOM begins its integration with DOM and HTML.\n",
